      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this would work. \n\nThe better fix would be removing the entry from base_vendor.mk to allow devices to choose, but that might be really disruptive because there may be a ton of devices that rely on it always being included.\n\nI think if we removed it from base_vendor.mk, it could lead to no build-time errors, but runtime errors that might be hard for people to debug.\n\n@hgchen@google.com, @quxiangfang@google.com what do you want to do about this?",
